%[text] # Practice Linear Regression
%[text] [⇦ Linear Regression](file:./LinearRegressionSoln.m)
%[text] After learning the principles of [linear regression](file:./LinearRegressionSoln.m), this exercise allows you to demonstrate your understanding through practical applications in MATLAB.
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![Image of a person connected to a ventilator](text:image:459c)
%[text]{"align":"center"} 
%[text] Learn and apply the linear regression workflow in MATLAB below. 
%[text] 
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"} %[text:anchor:M_597CA885]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_51183E7B] **Before you get started:**
